@startuml run-sequence
title M3b successful admission, inspection and persistence
actor User
participant Host
participant InspectionEngine as Engine
participant InspectionRunner as Runner
participant IDevice as Device
participant IInspector as Inspector
participant "NativeInspection.dll" as DLL
participant IResultStore as Store
User -> Host : run pass or fail scenario
Host -> Engine : Start(job, timeout)
Engine -> Engine : reserve slot / create RunId
Engine --> Host : Accepted + handle.Completion
Engine ->> Runner : run with admitted RunId and owned token
Runner -> Device : PrepareAsync(job, token)
Device --> Runner : ready
Runner -> Device : AcquireAsync(job, token)
Device --> Runner : samples
Runner -> Inspector : InspectAsync(job, samples, token)
opt native inspector selected
Inspector -> DLL : Start(handle, samples, count, callback, rooted context)
DLL --> Inspector : input copied / worker started
Inspector -> DLL : Wait(handle)
DLL -> Inspector : progress callbacks (0..count)
Inspector --> DLL : callback returns
DLL --> Inspector : worker joined / operation status + result
Inspector -> Inspector : unregister token / release callback context and extra handle reference
Inspector -> Inspector : validate result / convert errors
end
Inspector --> Runner : assessment (Pass or Fail)
Runner -> Engine : enter persistence under shared lock
Engine --> Runner : Persisting
note right of Runner : cancellation accepted before this point prevents saving
Runner -> Store : SaveAsync(result, CancellationToken.None)
Store -> Store : write temporary file, then rename
Store --> Runner : persisted
Runner --> Engine : InspectionResult
Engine -> Engine : close stop admission / finish callbacks and timer cleanup
Engine -> Engine : Succeeded / release slot / complete handle
Engine --> Host : await handle.Completion
Host --> User : Succeeded + RunId + verdict + result path
Host -> Engine : await DisposeAsync()
opt native inspector selected
Host -> Inspector : await DisposeAsync()
Inspector -> DLL : inspection_destroy(handle) via SafeHandle
end
note over Runner, Store
Late cancellation or timeout cannot replace storage outcome.
Save failure throws InspectionRunException with the computed result.
end note
@enduml
